Subject: [PATCH] backlight: ktz8866: keep the pre-curve default output

The brightness curve maps backlight levels to hardware values, so the
default level 1500 now drives the panel at 1764. Default to level 1024,
which maps to the previous hardware value of 1500.

--- a/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8866.c
+++ b/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8866.c
@@ -19,7 +19,7 @@
 #include <linux/of.h>
 #include <linux/regmap.h>
 
-#define DEFAULT_BRIGHTNESS 1500
+#define DEFAULT_BRIGHTNESS 1024
 #define MAX_BRIGHTNESS 2047
 #define REG_MAX 0x15
 
